  title: Keep the Lanterns Burning
  requiredClassId: 
  requiredLevel: 30
  version: 1
  offer: I tend the lamps around Lanternmere. Thornlashes have crept onto the lower bank, and Sporecaps are puffing into the upper trail. Thin them out so I can make the circuit. The amber Lanterncaps leave us alone if we leave them alone.
  activeDialogue: Follow the lamplit trail around the spring. Clear three Thornlashes and two Sporecaps, then come back to me.
  locationHint: Leave Arborium's West Gate and follow the lanterns to the forest trailhead.
  turnInHint: Return to Warden Lethen at the Lanternmere trailhead.
